                            <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-box-archive w-5 text-amber-600"></i> Dịch vụ đã đặt
                            </span>
                            <span class="bg-amber-200/70 text-amber-800 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">44</span>
